      "src": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/reasoning_model; https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/thinking_mode; RoleCall:apps/rc/src/lib/providers/adapters/openai.ts@fb8dc623e (lines 268-283)",
      "note": "Thinking-only alias. temperature/top_p/penalties are accepted but have no effect, so none are sent. With tools, every past assistant turn must carry its reasoning_content (§8.4). Any tool_choice is answered with 400 'does not support this tool_choice' (RoleCall prod logs), so it is never sent.",
      "caps": {
        "toolChoice": [],
